          %p
            We define a
            %em morphism of objects with directed path space
            to be a morphism of their underlying objects that preserves directed paths (i.e. if
            = succeed "," do
              %math#mathml_8bf95d3c2674448993e25648d0a96a855a987674_34.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
